    <string name="about_body">Version %1$s\n\nYour files are processed only on your device.\n\nIndependent app, not affiliated with WhatsApp or Meta.</string>
    <string name="help_title">How it works</string>
    <string name="help_body">1. View statuses in WhatsApp.\n\n2. Tap Allow access and confirm access to the WhatsApp folder. Accounts are found automatically.\n\n3. Open a status and tap the download arrow to save it.\n\nSwipe left or right to switch tabs.\n\nIf Android opens another folder, select WhatsApp inside Android › media › com.whatsapp. You do not need to find accounts or .Statuses.\n\nTo use WhatsApp Business, change Source in the menu.</string>
