    <string name="gestures_title">Viewer gestures</string>
    <string name="gestures_body">Pinch: zoom in or out on images and videos.\n\nDouble-tap: zoom an image or the center of a video.\n\nSwipe up or down on the left: brightness, for images and videos.\n\nOn videos, swipe up or down on the right: volume. Double-tap the left or right edge to skip back or forward 5 seconds.\n\nWhen zoomed in, drag to move the image. Swipe sideways without zoom to change statuses.</string>
